# Smoke test for bilibili_fans. Two screenshots:
# - 01_initial: post-init / pre-action. The first process tick has
#   already fired WIFI_CONN -> update_fans_num -> data is in run_data,
#   but display_bilibili was called with the OLD (zero) values BEFORE
#   the synchronous fetch returned, so the screen still shows "0/0".
# - 02_with_data: after `action UP` re-runs process which now
#   formats fans_num/follow_num from the fetched run_data
#   (12345 -> "1.2w" / 520).
#
# Together these verify both the default-render path and the
# post-fetch render path.

app bilibili

wait_ms 400
screenshot 01_initial
assert_no_crash

action UP
wait_ms 400
screenshot 02_with_data
assert_no_crash

action RETURN
wait_ms 200
assert_no_crash
